            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Contact support"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "help.faq.0.a": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Non. Krezus fonctionne exclusivement en argent fictif : 1 000 € virtuels au départ, aucune transaction sur un instrument financier réel, aucun gain ni aucune perte. Rien n'est à déclarer aux impôts."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No. Krezus runs entirely on paper money: €1,000 in virtual cash to start, no transaction on a real financial instrument, no gain and no loss. There is nothing to declare to the tax authorities."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "help.faq.0.q": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L'argent est-il réel ?"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Is the money real?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "help.faq.1.a": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Des places US et Euronext Paris, avec un différé de 15 minutes imposé par la licence de redistribution. La pastille « différé 15 min » est affichée partout où un prix apparaît."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "From US exchanges and Euronext Paris, with a 15-minute delay required by the redistribution licence. The “delayed 15 min” badge appears wherever a price is shown."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "help.faq.1.q": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "D'où viennent les cours ?"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Where do the prices come from?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "help.faq.2.a": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Par les missions du jour : 50 XP à l'activation du compte, 20 XP pour une leçon terminée et 30 XP pour un quiz réussi. Enchaîner dix leçons d'affilée ne rapporte donc pas dix fois 20 XP — le plafond est quotidien, pour que la régularité compte plus que le marathon."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Through the daily missions: 50 XP when you activate your account, 20 XP for a finished lesson and 30 XP for a passed quiz. Running through ten lessons in a row therefore doesn't earn ten times 20 XP — the cap is daily, so that consistency counts more than marathons."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "help.faq.2.q": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Comment gagne-t-on de l'XP ?"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "How do you earn XP?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "help.faq.3.a": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ton pseudo, ton rang, ta série et ta performance en pourcentage. Jamais un montant, jamais la composition de ton portefeuille."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your username, your rank, your streak and your percentage performance. Never an amount, never what your portfolio holds."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "help.faq.3.q": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Que voient mes amis dans l'Arena ?"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What do my friends see in the Arena?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "help.faq.4.a": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Non, et c'est délibéré. Hercule explique ce que fait une entreprise, ce que signifie un ratio, comment lire une variation. Il ne formule aucune recommandation personnalisée d'achat ou de vente : ce serait du conseil en investissement, un métier réglementé."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No, and that is deliberate. Hercule explains what a company does, what a ratio means, how to read a change. He makes no personalised buy or sell recommendation: that would be investment advice, a regulated profession."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "help.faq.4.q": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hercule peut-il me dire quoi acheter ?"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Can Hercule tell me what to buy?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "help.faq.5.a": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "5,99 € par mois via l'App Store, résiliable à tout moment depuis les réglages de ton compte Apple. Il débloque les 27 leçons, le brief du jour et l'analyse comportementale."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "€5.99 a month through the App Store, cancellable at any time from your Apple account settings. It unlocks all 27 lessons, the daily brief and behavioural insights."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "help.faq.5.q": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Comment fonctionne l'abonnement Premium ?"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "How does the Premium subscription work?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "help.faq.6.a": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Oui : Profil → Réinitialiser le portefeuille remet le solde à 1 000 € fictifs et solde les positions. Ta progression Academy, ton rang et tes badges sont conservés."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Yes: Profile → Reset portfolio puts the balance back to €1,000 in paper money and closes your positions. Your Academy progress, rank and badges are kept."
          }
        }
      }
    },
